<title>USA: PRI sees Q1 revs within expectations.</title>
<headline>PRI sees Q1 revs within expectations.</headline>
<dateline>BILLERICA, Mass. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PRI Automation Inc said on Wednesday said that it expects to report revenues and earnings next week for its first fiscal quarter within analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>The company said that bookings for the quarter continued strong and will show a healthy, greater than 1.0 book-to-bill ratio.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
